                                        "entry_id": "08ded5be-9e00-3604-803f-6fa6a26609df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various small flies of the genera Lutzomyia and Phlebotomus whose females suck the blood of vertebrates and thus spread leishmaniasis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
